                <invention-title lang="de">DYNAMISCHES AUSGANGSLEISTUNGSMANAGEMENT FÜR EINE ELEKTRONISCHE RAUCHVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">GESTION DYNAMIQUE DE PUISSANCE DE SORTIE POUR DISPOSITIF À FUMER ÉLECTRONIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DYNAMIC OUTPUT POWER MANAGEMENT FOR ELECTRONIC SMOKING DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electronic smoking device is disclosed, the electronic smoking device comprising: an atomizer including an electrical resistance heating element (10); a power source (20) connected to the heating element (10) and to a controller; a first switching element (30) connected between the heating element (10) and the power source (20); a voltage detection device (201) connected to the controller and to the power source (20) for measuring output voltage of the power source (20); a memory (203) for providing the resistance of the heating element (10) configured for storing a resistance value; and wherein the controller is configured to adjust electrical power supplied from the power source (20) to the heating element (10) based on power source voltage and the provided resistance of the heating element (10).</p>
            </abstract>
